research subject is to see the decrease in Cd levels using carbonized and non-carbonized coffee grounds
activated charcoal with a Pretest and Posttest design. Leachate water sampling was carried out at the
Tamangapa landfill, Makassar City. The sampling location was carried out considering that the location is the
